  "body": "## Changelog\r\n\r\n### 🚀 Features\r\n\r\n- Add `.deb` and `.rpm` packages for Linux on amd64 and arm64\r\n\r\n### 🐛 Bug Fixes\r\n\r\n- Connections\r\n  - Fix daemon startup when TUN needs admin permissions\r\n  - Fix DNS resolution and TUN addresses in different IP modes\r\n  - New configurations now use IPv4 by default. IPv6 mode prefers IPv6 but can fall back to IPv4\r\n  - Raise the minimum TUN MTU to 1280\r\n- Imports\r\n  - Fix HTTPUpgrade paths and keep custom headers when importing configs\r\n  - Allow query parameters in XHTTP paths\r\n- Interface\r\n  - Show the save hint only after changing settings\r\n  - Dim settings options that aren't selected\r\n  - Keep the selection in place when the daemon disconnects\r\n\r\n### ♻️ Refactoring\r\n\r\n- Give daemon logs a consistent format and add timestamps to engine logs\r\n- Clear old logs when the daemon starts\r\n- Simplify shutdown, Windows autostart, and installers\r\n- Remove duplicate CLI requests and fix flaky startup tests\r\n\r\n### 📦 Dependencies\r\n\r\n- Update sing-box-lx, QUIC, terminal libraries, and Go 1.27.3\r\n\r\nFull Changelog: [v1.8.0...v1.8.1](https://github.com/luynrs/justray/compare/v1.8.0...v1.8.1)\r\n"
}
